WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.735
-Last week was the third
Democratic debate,

00:00:02.735 --> 00:00:04.437
where 10 presidential hopefuls
went head-to-head.

00:00:04.437 --> 00:00:06.539
You know, I was actually going
to make a joke about this story,

00:00:06.539 --> 00:00:07.806
but I don't think
it needs a joke.

00:00:07.806 --> 00:00:09.075
I think it needs
to be slow jammed.

00:00:09.075 --> 00:00:10.343
You know what
I'm talking about, Tariq?

00:00:10.343 --> 00:00:11.877
-Yeah, Jimmy.
I think you're saying

00:00:11.877 --> 00:00:13.846
you want to slow jam this news.
-That's right.

00:00:13.846 --> 00:00:17.784
I want to slow jam the news,
and I'm not the only one.

00:00:17.784 --> 00:00:19.819
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:26.859 --> 00:00:28.594
-Hi.

00:00:28.594 --> 00:00:30.663
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:36.569
So, hello.

00:00:36.569 --> 00:00:38.271
I am Senator Kamala Harris,

00:00:38.271 --> 00:00:40.940
and I, too, would like
to slow jam this news.

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:43.009
-Well, hit me six times!

00:00:43.009 --> 00:00:48.548
♪♪

00:00:48.548 --> 00:00:50.483
-During last week's debate,

00:00:50.483 --> 00:00:53.452
I told the American people
why I'm running for president.

00:00:53.452 --> 00:00:56.289
I'm a public servant,
a civil-rights leader,

00:00:56.289 --> 00:00:58.291
and the second African-American
woman in history

00:00:58.291 --> 00:01:00.593
to be elected
to the United States Senate.

00:01:00.593 --> 00:01:02.194
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:02.194 --> 00:01:05.231
At the core of my campaign
is my 3:00 a.m. agenda,

00:01:05.231 --> 00:01:09.002
my plan to solve the issues
that keep Americans up at night.

00:01:09.002 --> 00:01:11.537
I'll implement
healthcare for all

00:01:11.537 --> 00:01:14.941
and even give middle-class
families $500 a month

00:01:14.941 --> 00:01:16.809
right in their pockets.

00:01:16.809 --> 00:01:19.545
And let me tell you something,
I'm just getting started.

00:01:19.545 --> 00:01:22.481
-Oh, yeah.

00:01:22.481 --> 00:01:25.518
Kamala Harris
is just heatin' up.

00:01:25.518 --> 00:01:27.653
She's thinkin' about you
late at night when you're trying

00:01:27.653 --> 00:01:31.424
to put that sweet restless body
of yours to bed.

00:01:31.424 --> 00:01:33.693
Is that $500 in your pocket

00:01:33.693 --> 00:01:36.763
or are you just happy
your healthcare is free?

00:01:36.763 --> 00:01:39.598
With Kamala, it's both.

00:01:39.598 --> 00:01:43.169
-♪ Ever since Barack left,
we've been off track ♪

00:01:43.169 --> 00:01:47.673
♪ But Kamala is trying
to get us back to black ♪

00:01:47.673 --> 00:01:50.176
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:50.176 --> 00:01:53.613
-Now, here's a question for you,
Kamala Cabello.

00:01:53.613 --> 00:01:55.982
[ Laughter ]

00:01:55.982 --> 00:01:58.351
This country's got a whole lot

00:01:58.351 --> 00:02:01.720
of hot-button issues
that we can touch on.

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:03.389
But what's the first thing
we need to do

00:02:03.389 --> 00:02:06.126
to give us all some relief?

00:02:06.126 --> 00:02:08.261
-Well, let me start
by saying this.

00:02:08.261 --> 00:02:10.563
Climate change
is the single greatest threat

00:02:10.563 --> 00:02:12.965
facing our world today.

00:02:12.965 --> 00:02:14.701
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:14.701 --> 00:02:17.670
That's why I'm committed
to passing a Green New Deal,

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:19.638
creating clean jobs,

00:02:19.638 --> 00:02:22.809
and finally putting an end
to fracking once and for all.

00:02:22.809 --> 00:02:26.212
-Mmm! Mmm-mmm-mmm.

00:02:26.212 --> 00:02:29.215
Mamala Kamala
just don't give a frack.

00:02:29.215 --> 00:02:33.218
She took a good look at Mother
Earth and decided it's a MILF.

00:02:33.218 --> 00:02:35.555
A Mother I'd Like to Fix.

00:02:35.555 --> 00:02:37.890
[ Laughter ]

00:02:37.890 --> 00:02:40.626
-♪ The planet is a MILF now ♪

00:02:40.626 --> 00:02:42.061
♪ All right ♪

00:02:42.061 --> 00:02:43.929
-All right.

00:02:43.929 --> 00:02:47.500
-♪ When it comes to climate,
she's a real front-runner ♪

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:51.370
♪ She's heatin' up like
it's still hot girl summer ♪

00:02:51.370 --> 00:02:53.772
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:53.772 --> 00:02:56.342
-I like the way you work it,
K. Higgity.

00:02:56.342 --> 00:02:58.010
But I gotta ask.

00:02:58.010 --> 00:03:00.012
Lately this country
has been so divided,

00:03:00.012 --> 00:03:01.947
sleeping on opposite sides
of the bed.

00:03:01.947 --> 00:03:05.418
Why do you think we can't all
just come together?

00:03:05.418 --> 00:03:07.987
-Well, it's my opinion
that we need a president

00:03:07.987 --> 00:03:10.690
who fights for the best
of who we are.

00:03:10.690 --> 00:03:12.959
And over the past three years,

00:03:12.959 --> 00:03:16.029
Donald Trump has done
the exact opposite.

00:03:16.029 --> 00:03:17.530
-Hold up.

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:21.233
So what you're trying to say
is that Trump's the bad guy?

00:03:21.233 --> 00:03:28.241
♪♪

00:03:28.241 --> 00:03:30.209
-Duh.

00:03:30.209 --> 00:03:32.845
♪♪

00:03:32.845 --> 00:03:35.915
-Now, tell me this, Kama Kama
Kama Kama Kamala Harris.

00:03:35.915 --> 00:03:37.617
By now, we've seen the Democrats

00:03:37.617 --> 00:03:40.386
get down and dirty
on the debate stage.

00:03:40.386 --> 00:03:42.655
What about debating
President Trump?

00:03:42.655 --> 00:03:44.156
Do you think
you could deliver the goods

00:03:44.156 --> 00:03:46.692
against the
commander in cheese puff?

00:03:46.692 --> 00:03:50.163
-Well, Jimmy,
if I do debate President Trump,

00:03:50.163 --> 00:03:52.298
I'm sure it'll be
a competitive faceoff

00:03:52.298 --> 00:03:56.035
where either one of us
could end up on top.

00:03:56.035 --> 00:03:57.469
-Really?

00:03:57.469 --> 00:04:00.339
-No. I'd wipe
the floor with him.

00:04:00.339 --> 00:04:02.608
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:02.608 --> 00:04:04.410
-All right, all right.

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:07.446
One last tango in Harris
before this interview's over.

00:04:07.446 --> 00:04:08.848
Now, we've got an audience

00:04:08.848 --> 00:04:10.850
jam-packed with college students
here tonight.

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:12.918
So what would you tell
these curious coeds

00:04:12.918 --> 00:04:15.220
that you haven't already?

00:04:15.220 --> 00:04:16.623
-Well, just that together,

00:04:16.623 --> 00:04:19.692
we can create the America
we believe in.

00:04:19.692 --> 00:04:22.494
We can uplift
vulnerable communities,

00:04:22.494 --> 00:04:26.265
and we can finally recognize
that crippling student-loan debt

00:04:26.265 --> 00:04:28.267
is a burden on all of us.

00:04:28.267 --> 00:04:31.370
That's why we need
to make college debt-free

00:04:31.370 --> 00:04:33.306
for every American to attend.

00:04:33.306 --> 00:04:35.375
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:35.375 --> 00:04:36.875
-Wow.

00:04:36.875 --> 00:04:40.646
Now, that's someone who knows
how to play to a college crowd.

00:04:40.646 --> 00:04:43.349
Well, guess what.
Two can play at that game.

00:04:43.349 --> 00:04:46.719
Oh, yeah.
White Claw fall.

00:04:46.719 --> 00:04:48.854
Ow!

00:04:48.854 --> 00:04:50.556
-Jimmy. Jimmy.

00:04:50.556 --> 00:04:52.892
Uh, do less.

00:04:52.892 --> 00:04:56.762
-♪ Kamala just dropped
a bomb-a-la ♪

00:04:56.762 --> 00:05:01.533
-It's time for a leader
who leads with their heart.

00:05:01.533 --> 00:05:04.603
-We must stand together,
or we'll all fall apart.

00:05:04.603 --> 00:05:08.407
-♪ The nation is down,
but we can rebound ♪

00:05:08.407 --> 00:05:12.411
♪ The future is female,
and her time is now ♪

00:05:12.411 --> 00:05:16.048
♪ This girl is on fire,
don't step on the fuse ♪

00:05:16.048 --> 00:05:20.319
-And that is how
we slow jam the news.

00:05:20.319 --> 00:05:21.887
-Oh, yeah.

00:05:21.887 --> 00:05:24.490
-Give it up for
Senator Kamala Harris!

00:05:24.490 --> 00:05:27.060
[ Cheers and applause ]

